      "postID": "5a355aaf6949fa4b48fc2807",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "From my understanding, this is an issue with the way Cubed's shader creates the outline on avatars. It's not related to VRChat, it's something that AMD broke in their drivers (the Jan 2017 AMD driver still works). There is a recently released version of Cubed's shader that doesn't have the outline option, which will display correctly for users with AMD GPUs. Past that, this is not something VRChat can fix on their end.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
