  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2017-12-16T17:41:03.226Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "After the latest update, for some reason, now avatars who have a shader (So far its been Flat Lit Tooner) disappear and I'm not alone, as the avatars and others will not appear again unless the game is restarted, and even then it happens again. My shoes aren't Flat Lit so I know its the shader. Some are saying its related to the AMD, but we haven't found the source, so it is most likely from the Games coding possibly? I tried re-uploading with the new SDK and the same thing happened. ANY help as to why this is happening would be greatly appreciated so I can help the others.\n\nGraphics Card is ; AMD RX 570 series",
